MobileNet – Simple Real-Time Explanation

Imagine you are working in a large warehouse and need to identify products.

Traditional CNN (Like VGG16)

One worker does everything:

Looks at the product
Identifies features
Decides the category

This worker is very skilled but slow and expensive.

For 10,000 products, it takes a lot of time.

MobileNet

Instead of one worker doing everything:

Worker 1: Finds Features

Looks only for:

Shape
Edges
Colors
Patterns
Worker 2: Makes Decision

Combines those features and says:

✅ This is a bottle

✅ This is a laptop

✅ This is a car

Because the work is divided, it becomes much faster.

This is exactly how MobileNet works using:

Depthwise Convolution → Find features
Pointwise Convolution → Combine features and classify
