One-Line Understanding

MobileNet is a lightweight AI model that recognizes images quickly by splitting the work into two simple steps—first finding important features and then identifying the object—making it ideal for mobile apps, CCTV systems, IoT devices, and real-time projects like Smart E.B Meter Reading.

Easy Example

Think of MobileNet like a supermarket billing counter:

Employee 1 scans products (finds features).
Employee 2 calculates the bill (makes the decision).

Because the work is divided, customers move through the queue much faster.

That is exactly why MobileNet is fast and efficient in real-world AI applications.
